1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,119
Why an S?

2
00:00:01,119 --> 00:00:08,098
Early on, both daughter cells keep dividing, so growth is geometric: exponential.

3
00:00:08,098 --> 00:00:16,523
Later, only one daughter keeps dividing while the other differentiates, so growth becomes arithmetic, a straight line.

4
00:00:16,523 --> 00:00:17,734
Then it stops.

5
00:00:17,734 --> 00:00:21,601
Fast, then steady, then flat: the S.

